    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cheese Maze</strong> is a fun and clever puzzle adventure for all ages! Guide a curious little mouse through a maze filled with exciting challenges and surprises. Each level is packed with tricky obstacles and creative puzzles. Think carefully to find your way out, but watch out for the sneaky Cat that\u2019s always on the prowl! Gather every piece of delicious cheese and bring it safely home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you complete every challenge and become the Maze Master?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was made with \ud83d\udc97 love and \ud83e\uddc0 cheese, just for YOU!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc2d A brave and adorable Mouse</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude3c\ud83d\ude3c\ud83d\ude3c Mischievous Cats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u26a0\ufe0f Creative and tricky traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde9 40 handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddc0\ud83e\uddc0\ud83e\uddc0 Lots and lots of CHEESE!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 Fun, brain-boosting puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Arcade-style gameplay for quick and exciting sessions</p></li></ul>",
